#, fuzzy
msgid ""
msgstr ""#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:1
msgid "bl.alloc 接口文档"
msgstr "bl.alloc API Documentation"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:3
msgid "1. 背景"
msgstr "1\. Background"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:5
msgid "为了支持Ascend级编程的需要，需要支持用户手动创建指定地址空间上的内存(buffer)，本接口是硬件无关的接口，对接memref.alloc。"
msgstr ""
"To support Ascend-level programming, users need to be able to manually"
"create memory (buffers) in a specified address space. This interface is"
"hardware-agnostic and maps to `memref.alloc`."

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:7
msgid "2. 接口说明"
msgstr "2\. Interface Description"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:15
msgid "3. 返回值"
msgstr "3\. Return Value"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:17
msgid ""
"返回一个buffer language下的buffer类型，与triton "
"language下的tensor做语义上的隔离，不支持相互赋值，需要to_tensor和to_buffer来显式转换；表示一段分配在指定地址空间的内存，携带数据类型、形状和地址空间三部分信息。"
msgstr ""
"Returns a `buffer` object in the buffer language, semantically isolated"
"from a `tensor` in the Triton language. Mutual assignment is not"
"supported; explicit conversion through `to_tensor` and `to_buffer` is"
"required. It represents a block of memory allocated in a specified"
"address space and carries three pieces of information: data type, shape,"
"and address space."

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:19
msgid "4. 入参"
msgstr "4\. Parameters"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:54
msgid "5. 昇腾平台数据类型支持"
msgstr "5\. Data Type Support on the Ascend Platform"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:91
msgid "6. 约束说明"
msgstr "6\. Constraints"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:93
msgid "dtype不支持tl.void"
msgstr "`dtype` does not support `tl.void`"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:95
msgid "shape每个元素必须是正整数"
msgstr "Every element in `shape` must be a positive integer"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:97
msgid "需自行保证符合指定的地址空间上的大小限制"
msgstr ""
"You must ensure that the size limits of the specified address space"
"are respected"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/alloc.md:99
msgid "address_space参数默认为空，表示不携带任何地址空间信息"
msgstr ""
"The `address_space` parameter is empty by default, meaning no"
"address-space information is attached"

